==Match officials==
On 12 September 2023, a total of 26 referees, 30 assistants and 12 [[video assistant referee]]s (VAR) were named for the tournament.<ref name="referees">{{cite web |date=7 October 2023 |title=CAF names TotalEnergies CAF Africa Cup of Nations, Cote d'Ivoire 2023 Match Officials |url=https://www.cafonline.com/caf-africa-cup-of-nations/news/caf-names-totalenergies-caf-africa-cup-of-nations-cote-d-ivoire-2023-match-officials-1/ |access-date=7 October 2023 |publisher=Confederation of African Football|website=CAFonline.com}}</ref> In January 2024, [[Bouchra Karboubi]] became the first woman from [[North Africa]] and the [[Arab world]] to officiate a men's AFCON match by refereeing the match between [[Guinea-Bissau national football team|Guinea-Bissau]] and [[Nigeria national football team|Nigeria]] in the third day of the group stage.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.lopinion.ma/CAN-2023-Bouchra-Karboubi-premiere-femme-arabe-a-officier-en-tant-qu-arbitre-principale_a49217.html |title= CAN 2023 : Bouchra Karboubi, première femme arabe à officier en tant qu'arbitre principale|trans-title=CAN 2023: Bouchra Karboubi, the first Arab woman to officiate as the main referee |website=[[L'Opinion]] |date=2024-01-22 |access-date=2024-01-24|language=fr}}</ref>

